{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31055","headline":"春日使府寓怀二首 二 · 薛能","name":"春日使府寓怀二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生无解亦无操，永日书生坐独劳。\n唯觉宦情如水薄，不知人事有山高。\n孤心好直迍犹强，病发慵梳痒更搔。\n何事故溪归未得，几抛清浅泛红桃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31055.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31055","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}